{
  "title": "Oven Roasted Saudi Arabian Bacon Kebabs",
  "description": "Savory and energizing Saudi Arabian dish featuring bacon lardon, this recipe combines the flavors of the Middle East with the convenience of oven roasting. It is a perfect dish for a weeknight dinner.",
  "cuisine": "Saudi Arabian",
